  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你相信吗，人生是不需要努力的，你只需要不断地筛选自己的环境，找到契合自己的高能量的环境，然后让自己闲下来，你就能快速改变命运。越是在没有熟人的地方，你越是能够自信和从容，人走得越远，才能离自己越近，人是环境的产物，但不是环境的囚徒，千万不要在坏的环境里，考验自己的意志力。#治愈力 #成长 #读书 #改变环境",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 147.514921,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱君，你相信吗？人生是不需要努力的，你只需要不断的筛选自己的环境，找到契合自己的高能量的环境，然后让自己闲下来，你就能快速改变命运。你有没有发现，越是在没有熟人的地方，你就越是能够自信和从容，这就是人走得越远，才能够离自己越近。一棵树长不好，不一定是种子的问题，也可能是土壤不对人是环境的产物，但不是环境的囚徒，千万不要在有毒的环境里考验自己的意志力。一个人成长的上限，不取决于你努力的程度，而取决于你曾经接触过的最高标准。长期处在第一标准，环境里人就会把含糊当正常。而一旦见过更高的版本，你就很难再妥协了。很少有人意识到环境远大于你的能力。其实绝大部分的工作都不需要什么能力。你之所以没有办法找到好工作，不是因为这个工作你干不了，而是你进不去，你进去就会发现工作内容其实非常普通，可惜你没有进去的敲门砖。你要找到一个能够把你当人才的环境，去寻找那个让你持续成长发挥所长，实现价值的环境。找到一个很旺你的环境。我们总相信人定胜天，觉得靠意志力就能对抗一切。但现实是我见过太多曾经眼里有光、性情温和的人，在一段持续消耗的关系或一个高压环境里，被一点点磨掉了光彩。他们变得焦虑易怒，连自己都觉得陌生。要知道，一个人能够持续的状态稳定，往往不是因为他天生乐观坚强，更大的可能是他幸运的。身处在一个能够滋养他的环境，在一个斤斤计较的环境中，你很难生出宽容和慈悲、优雅和体面。我们说的改变环境，并不是说非要去搬家，而是换一个信息环境，改变自己的大脑。改变每天接触的人，你相信吗？你每天接触最多的六个人，这六个人的平均值大概就是你那个最真实的。你要想取得远超同龄人财富体量，你就要远离他们的一切。一个人如果不读书又不去看世界，那他的认知和三观就会由身边的人去决定。荒芜里是开不出花的。如果你觉得你的思维超越了你的阶层，请坚信你不属于这个阶层，你值得去个更大的地方。不要只顾着低头努力，更要抬头选择方向。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00001",
      "start_ms": 260,
      "end_ms": 660,
      "text": "朱君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1040,
      "end_ms": 1800,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2080,
      "end_ms": 3760,
      "text": "人生是不需要努力的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3880,
      "end_ms": 6100,
      "text": "你只需要不断的筛选自己的环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6400,
      "end_ms": 8660,
      "text": "找到契合自己的高能量的环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8840,
      "end_ms": 10820,
      "text": "然后让自己闲下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10880,
      "end_ms": 12440,
      "text": "你就能快速改变命运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12860,
      "end_ms": 13760,
      "text": "你有没有发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14000,
      "end_ms": 15720,
      "text": "越是在没有熟人的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15800,
      "end_ms": 17820,
      "text": "你就越是能够自信和从容，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00011",
      "start_ms": 18060,
      "end_ms": 19740,
      "text": "这就是人走得越远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19940,
      "end_ms": 21360,
      "text": "才能够离自己越近。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21660,
      "end_ms": 22600,
      "text": "一棵树长不好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00014",
      "start_ms": 22600,
      "end_ms": 23980,
      "text": "不一定是种子的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24060,
      "end_ms": 27460,
      "text": "也可能是土壤不对人是环境的产物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00016",
      "start_ms": 27620,
      "end_ms": 28920,
      "text": "但不是环境的囚徒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00017",
      "start_ms": 28920,
      "end_ms": 32630,
      "text": "千万不要在有毒的环境里考验自己的意志力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32910,
      "end_ms": 34310,
      "text": "一个人成长的上限，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00019",
      "start_ms": 34350,
      "end_ms": 36050,
      "text": "不取决于你努力的程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00020",
      "start_ms": 36190,
      "end_ms": 38910,
      "text": "而取决于你曾经接触过的最高标准。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39530,
      "end_ms": 41290,
      "text": "长期处在第一标准，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41290,
      "end_ms": 43650,
      "text": "环境里人就会把含糊当正常。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43870,
      "end_ms": 45390,
      "text": "而一旦见过更高的版本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45450,
      "end_ms": 46870,
      "text": "你就很难再妥协了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47010,
      "end_ms": 50350,
      "text": "很少有人意识到环境远大于你的能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00026",
      "start_ms": 50710,
      "end_ms": 53270,
      "text": "其实绝大部分的工作都不需要什么能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00027",
      "start_ms": 53610,
      "end_ms": 55550,
      "text": "你之所以没有办法找到好工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00028",
      "start_ms": 55810,
      "end_ms": 57410,
      "text": "不是因为这个工作你干不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00029",
      "start_ms": 57610,
      "end_ms": 58970,
      "text": "而是你进不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00030",
      "start_ms": 59450,
      "end_ms": 62815,
      "text": "你进去就会发现工作内容其实非常普通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00031",
      "start_ms": 63100,
      "end_ms": 64845,
      "text": "可惜你没有进去的敲门砖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00032",
      "start_ms": 65400,
      "end_ms": 67880,
      "text": "你要找到一个能够把你当人才的环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00033",
      "start_ms": 68080,
      "end_ms": 71100,
      "text": "去寻找那个让你持续成长发挥所长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00034",
      "start_ms": 71140,
      "end_ms": 72345,
      "text": "实现价值的环境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00035",
      "start_ms": 72610,
      "end_ms": 74235,
      "text": "找到一个很旺你的环境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00036",
      "start_ms": 74670,
      "end_ms": 76470,
      "text": "我们总相信人定胜天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00037",
      "start_ms": 76690,
      "end_ms": 78765,
      "text": "觉得靠意志力就能对抗一切。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00038",
      "start_ms": 79100,
      "end_ms": 83085,
      "text": "但现实是我见过太多曾经眼里有光、性情温和的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00039",
      "start_ms": 83300,
      "end_ms": 86265,
      "text": "在一段持续消耗的关系或一个高压环境里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00040",
      "start_ms": 86470,
      "end_ms": 88270,
      "text": "被一点点磨掉了光彩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00041",
      "start_ms": 88430,
      "end_ms": 89930,
      "text": "他们变得焦虑易怒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00042",
      "start_ms": 90090,
      "end_ms": 91405,
      "text": "连自己都觉得陌生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00043",
      "start_ms": 91720,
      "end_ms": 92225,
      "text": "要知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00044",
      "start_ms": 92500,
      "end_ms": 94780,
      "text": "一个人能够持续的状态稳定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00045",
      "start_ms": 94880,
      "end_ms": 96895,
      "text": "往往不是因为他天生乐观坚强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00046",
      "start_ms": 97370,
      "end_ms": 99070,
      "text": "更大的可能是他幸运的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00047",
      "start_ms": 99070,
      "end_ms": 101025,
      "text": "身处在一个能够滋养他的环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00048",
      "start_ms": 101380,
      "end_ms": 103080,
      "text": "在一个斤斤计较的环境中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00049",
      "start_ms": 103140,
      "end_ms": 106425,
      "text": "你很难生出宽容和慈悲、优雅和体面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00050",
      "start_ms": 106920,
      "end_ms": 108100,
      "text": "我们说的改变环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00051",
      "start_ms": 108100,
      "end_ms": 109405,
      "text": "并不是说非要去搬家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00052",
      "start_ms": 109710,
      "end_ms": 111305,
      "text": "而是换一个信息环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00053",
      "start_ms": 111680,
      "end_ms": 112765,
      "text": "改变自己的大脑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00054",
      "start_ms": 112980,
      "end_ms": 114305,
      "text": "改变每天接触的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00055",
      "start_ms": 114690,
      "end_ms": 115415,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00056",
      "start_ms": 115840,
      "end_ms": 117775,
      "text": "你每天接触最多的六个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00057",
      "start_ms": 118050,
      "end_ms": 121550,
      "text": "这六个人的平均值大概就是你那个最真实的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00058",
      "start_ms": 121550,
      "end_ms": 124840,
      "text": "你要想取得远超同龄人财富体量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00059",
      "start_ms": 124920,
      "end_ms": 126985,
      "text": "你就要远离他们的一切。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00060",
      "start_ms": 127630,
      "end_ms": 130010,
      "text": "一个人如果不读书又不去看世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00061",
      "start_ms": 130170,
      "end_ms": 133145,
      "text": "那他的认知和三观就会由身边的人去决定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00062",
      "start_ms": 133550,
      "end_ms": 135585,
      "text": "荒芜里是开不出花的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00063",
      "start_ms": 135840,
      "end_ms": 138305,
      "text": "如果你觉得你的思维超越了你的阶层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00064",
      "start_ms": 138550,
      "end_ms": 140815,
      "text": "请坚信你不属于这个阶层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00065",
      "start_ms": 141130,
      "end_ms": 142695,
      "text": "你值得去个更大的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00066",
      "start_ms": 143260,
      "end_ms": 144955,
      "text": "不要只顾着低头努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7bcb4e0b2af8d1aa_s00067",
      "start_ms": 145230,
      "end_ms": 147065,
      "text": "更要抬头选择方向。"
    }
  ],
